<title>UK: P&amp;O wins UK subsidies for Shetland ferries.</title>
<headline>P&amp;O wins UK subsidies for Shetland ferries.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Peninsular and Oriental Steam Navigation Co said on Thursday it won government subsidies to operate passenger ferry services to the Orkney and Shetland Islands off Scotland.</p>
</text>
